hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"21425","Abdullah narrated to us: Muhammad ibn Abi Bakr al-Muqaddami narrated to us: Abd al-Wahhab al-Thaqafi informed us from al-Muthanna from Amr ibn Shuayb from his father from Abdullah ibn Amr from Ubayy ibn Kab, may Allah Almighty be pleased with them both, who said: I said to the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him): And for pregnant women their term is that they deliver their burden, is it for the thrice-divorced and for her whose husband died. He said: It is for the thrice-divorced and for her whose husband died."
